{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the warm and bustling world of a seaside Italian bakery in this cooperative online simulation game! Whether you\u2019re a master baker or just starting out, the oven is waiting for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/bc9ead728515cee5ba789dc93664ddd0.avif?t=1772791612\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a variety of pizzas and breads and start cooking. Make your dough. Fire up your oven. And delight your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/9991b51cf7c03c54e94e9cb07a33436d.avif?t=1772791612\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have fun alone or with up to four friends. Divide tasks appropriately with your friends. Manage your bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/8b5a026910cfd18c12332c3d002c61ab.avif?t=1772791612\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perform thorough product inspections. If you can't deliver the product your customer wants on time, they'll be unhappy and leave. Buy the right products in the right quantity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to roll the dough, fire up the ovens, and create the ultimate seaside Italian bakery experience? Gather your friends, start baking, and serve up some delicious chaos!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Warm Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/bdd8874da18398b976716dd27fc8c9d99d0c6fed.jpg"},{"name":"Small Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/3a01ec899d986f6b916ab6ab94bc117ac9933c2e.jpg"},{"name":"Small Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/0282bd2815b13fd25aefd7b6385161cfb221bc41.jpg"},{"name":"Rolling in Dough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/71874ebffb048f5d1d1c2e087c83083ee11f8c10.jpg"},{"name":"At Your Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/d4316fa70ca8af7c026df3a22520942756c079ad.jpg"},{"name":"That Was Close!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/fd94306a28290d4b8137b1efb74d0d0b7a32eb67.jpg"},{"name":"Extra Crispy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/da83ead1707650a40c3e528129be517c28b27e92.jpg"},{"name":"Help Wanted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/a9b0e8b12855108817ce19a4c1c8b3771238dd07.jpg"},{"name":"Pop the Cork","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/964841a055b696272198d06db080269303cce874.jpg"},{"name":"Rising to the Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044510/de5e323c5633c2235d1809bdf246aa0e9d6d5e69.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044510?t=1772791612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset