propriately with your friends. Manage your bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/8b5a026910cfd18c12332c3d002c61ab.avif?t=1772791612\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perform thorough product inspections. If you can't deliver the product your customer wants on time, they'll be unhappy and leave. Buy the right products in the right quantity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to roll the dough, fire up the ovens, and create the ultimate seaside Italian bakery experience? Gather your friends, start baking, and serve up some delicious chaos!</p>","developers":["Editmode"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/4894ff7ec4a315fcd25576bbcd8fd7544413d3fc/header.jpg?t=1772791612","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044510/335909081/ab3ea7c3a715e6c30288619e1dfbdbde73703af4/1760805559/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771026251","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044510/335909081/ab3ea7c3a715e6c30288619e1dfbdbde73703af4/1760805559/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771026251","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/